<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="page-intro">
    <text class="intro-index">01 / PORTRAIT BACKGROUND</text>
    <text class="intro-title">一张清楚的人像，\n换好底色立刻可用。</text>
    <text class="intro-desc">通过本地颜色分析识别与边缘连通的区域，适合纯色背景照片。</text>
  </view>

  <button wx:if="{{!hasImage}}" class="empty-upload" bindtap="choosePhoto">
    <view class="upload-plus">+</view>
    <text class="upload-title">选择一张人像照片</text>
    <text class="upload-tip">建议正面、光线均匀、背景颜色单一</text>
  </button>

  <view wx:else class="workspace">
    <view class="preview-shell photo-preview">
      <image
        wx:if="{{resultSrc}}"
        class="preview-image"
        src="{{resultSrc}}"
        mode="widthFix"
        bindtap="previewResult"
      ></image>
      <view wx:else class="preview-loading">正在识别人像边缘…</view>
      <view class="preview-label">3:4 证件照预览</view>
    </view>

    <view class="toolbar">
      <text>已移除约 {{removedPercent}}% 的背景</text>
      <button bindtap="changePhoto">换一张</button>
    </view>

    <view class="card setting-group color-group">
      <view class="setting-head">
        <text class="setting-label">背景颜色</text>
        <text class="setting-value">{{backgroundKey === 'transparent' ? 'PNG 透明底' : '高清 900 × 1200'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="swatch-list">
        <button
          wx:for="{{backgrounds}}"
          wx:key="id"
          class="swatch-item {{backgroundKey === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}"
          data-key="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="chooseBackground"
        >
          <view
            class="swatch-color {{item.id === 'transparent' ? 'swatch-transparent' : ''}}"
            style="{{item.id === 'transparent' ? '' : 'background:' + item.color}}"
          >
            <text wx:if="{{backgroundKey === item.id}}">✓</text>
          </view>
          <text class="swatch-label">{{item.label}}</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card setting-group">
      <view class="setting-head">
        <text class="setting-label">识别容差</text>
        <text class="setting-value">{{tolerance}}</text>
      </view>
      <slider
        value="{{tolerance}}"
        min="12"
        max="82"
        step="1"
        activeColor="#1d6b4f"
        backgroundColor="#e2e5de"
        block-size="22"
        bindchange="onToleranceChange"
      />
      <view class="range-labels">
        <text>保留更多</text>
        <text>清除更彻底</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card setting-group">
      <view class="setting-head">
        <text class="setting-label">边缘柔化</text>
        <text class="setting-value">{{feather}} px</text>
      </view>
      <slider
        value="{{feather}}"
        min="0"
        max="8"
        step="1"
        activeColor="#1d6b4f"
        backgroundColor="#e2e5de"
        block-size="22"
        bindchange="onFeatherChange"
      />
      <view class="range-labels">
        <text>锐利</text>
        <text>柔和</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="notice">
      <view class="notice-dot"></view>
      <text>纯色背景效果最好。复杂背景、发丝和白衣边缘如不自然，可调低容差后重试。</text>
    </view>

    <button class="primary-button save-button" bindtap="saveResult">保存高清图片</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{processing}}" class="busy-mask">
    <view class="busy-spinner"></view>
    <text>正在处理图片…</text>
  </view>
  <privacy-dialog />
</view>

